h `[` and end with `]`.\n\n### Expected Output Schema:\n[\n  {\n    \"ID\": \"{{ $json.id }}\",\n    \"competitor\": \"{{ $json.author.name }}\",\n    \"is_speaking_engagement\": true,\n    \"Description\": \"Example description of the keynote event.\",\n    \"Company\": \"Example Corp\",\n    \"POC\": \"Jane Doe\"\n  }\n]"
